{"unit_id":"Xilin3__dsh-prompt-persona#card-zh","repo":"Xilin3/dsh-prompt-persona","commit":"de1c814724d1ef3b8bca25440e9859bc1642048f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@xilin3/dsh-prompt-persona 是 DSH Web 插件，可在设置页编辑部署 persona，并注入系统提示词。支持替换、追加或关闭，预览完整提示词后可保存到当前 profile；支持 model、cwd、provider 模板变量。若 agent preset 覆盖该提示词段，插件会保留原内容。适合希望定制 DSH 助手人设的用户，无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:71-108","lib/config.js:20-40","lib/web.js:117-131","lib/client.js:117-158"]}
{"unit_id":"Xilin3__dsh-prompt-persona#card-en","repo":"Xilin3/dsh-prompt-persona","commit":"de1c814724d1ef3b8bca25440e9859bc1642048f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@xilin3/dsh-prompt-persona lets DSH Web users edit a deployment persona in Settings and add it to the system prompt. Choose replace, append, or off, then preview the full prompt before saving. Templates support model, cwd, and provider variables. Higher-priority agent personas are preserved.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:71-108","lib/config.js:20-40","lib/web.js:117-131","lib/client.js:117-158"]}
