{"unit_id":"Xilin3__dsh-prompt-persona#feature-1","repo":"Xilin3/dsh-prompt-persona","commit":"de1c814724d1ef3b8bca25440e9859bc1642048f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@xilin3/dsh-prompt-persona 的功能「部署 persona 注入」：提示词组装时按 replace、append 或 off 模式应用自定义文本，且在更高优先级的 agent persona 遮蔽目标段时不覆盖它。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:95-108"]}
{"unit_id":"Xilin3__dsh-prompt-persona#feature-2","repo":"Xilin3/dsh-prompt-persona","commit":"de1c814724d1ef3b8bca25440e9859bc1642048f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@xilin3/dsh-prompt-persona 的功能「设置页编辑」：Web 设置面板提供 persona 多行编辑框和三种注入模式选择，供用户调整部署级系统提示词。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:117-145"]}
{"unit_id":"Xilin3__dsh-prompt-persona#feature-3","repo":"Xilin3/dsh-prompt-persona","commit":"de1c814724d1ef3b8bca25440e9859bc1642048f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@xilin3/dsh-prompt-persona 的功能「完整提示词预览」：点击预览后，服务端在组装结果副本上应用草稿并渲染完整提示词，当前运行状态不被改写。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/web.js:117-121"]}
{"unit_id":"Xilin3__dsh-prompt-persona#feature-4","repo":"Xilin3/dsh-prompt-persona","commit":"de1c814724d1ef3b8bca25440e9859bc1642048f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@xilin3/dsh-prompt-persona 的功能「配置保存与并发检查」：保存只更新 persona 和 mode 两项，并携带预期 revision；冲突时返回 409，避免静默覆盖较新的设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/web.js:123-131","lib/web.js:164-178"]}
{"unit_id":"Xilin3__dsh-prompt-persona#feature-5","repo":"Xilin3/dsh-prompt-persona","commit":"de1c814724d1ef3b8bca25440e9859bc1642048f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@xilin3/dsh-prompt-persona 的功能「模板变量渲染」：预览渲染时补全 model、cwd 与 provider，并在严格模板渲染失败时尝试替换已知变量。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/web.js:34-60"]}
{"unit_id":"Xilin3__dsh-prompt-persona#feature-6","repo":"Xilin3/dsh-prompt-persona","commit":"de1c814724d1ef3b8bca25440e9859bc1642048f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@xilin3/dsh-prompt-persona 的功能「当前提示词查看」：设置页读取并展示当前完整系统提示词；设置服务缺席或只读时仍可查看及预览，但保存不可用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/web.js:97-114","lib/client.js:147-153"]}
